  "details": "In the Worlds menu in the new Main Menu, the \"minimize the navigation panel\" button on the top left has lower priority than other buttons, making it hard to select. If there are any buttons under it, for example the header/banner or if you scroll down and there's a world under the button and you hover over the world first, it will not be selected unless you hover your mouse away from it. (Usually by moving your mouse from the left side of the quick menu where there are no buttons)",
